// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
// Registry of every EDA_* environment variable (X-macro, included by env.cpp). Every variable is a
// boolean (1/0, true/false, on/off, yes/no; empty = unset). The library rejects unregistered
// EDA_* names and invalid values.
//
// EDA_ENV(name, default, description); the description documents the variable here only.
EDA_ENV("EDA_SANITIZE", "0",
           "Sanitizer support: the workspace arena runs in debug mode (one device allocation per "
           "slice, allocated afresh on every bind and filled with 0xFF bytes, NaN, unless "
           "EDA_ARENA_POISON=0), the output rows are zeroed before use, and the tests shrink their "
           "shapes.")
EDA_ENV("EDA_ARENA_POISON", "1",
           "In arena debug mode (EDA_SANITIZE), fill new slices with 0xFF bytes so that stale reads "
           "produce NaN. Set 0 for initcheck, which counts any fill as initialization and would otherwise not "
           "report reads of never-written workspace.")
